{
  "model": "routing_router",
  "subject": "routing.router",
  "local_only": false,
  "comment": "Reference profile = the research Selector / Output12Router (headphone_mix.py) bit for bit. Profile-specific (app, Sixteen deviations, documented in models/routing_router.py): re-selecting the mode during its fade-out fades back in (reference: stuck at 0, F209 quirk; case mode_reselect_*); the mode dip on OUT 3-4..7-8, the per-track assignment dip, the assign rules, mono = (L + R) x 0.5 and absent-pair folding are app rules (our choice, MIX-030..033) with no reference counterpart, modelled with the research Selector.",
  "sample_rate": 44100,
  "block": 64,
  "tolerance": {"max_rel": 1e-06, "residual_dbfs": -100.0, "floor": 1e-30},
